<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42309" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sălĕ_brōsus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>full of joltings</i>, <i>rough</i>, <i>rugged</i>, <i>uneven</i> (not
			anteAug.; cf.: confragosus, horridus, asper). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">semita,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 8, p. 208, 37</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">furfures multo lapide,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 7</span></i>
			, p. 194, 38.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, of speech: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">resistens ac salebrosa oratio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 11, 2, 46</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">compositio Pollionis Asinii,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 100, 7</span></i>
			.—Of the writer himself: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sanctra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					11, 2, 7</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
